config BR2_PACKAGE_FAAC
	bool "faac"
	help
	  Freeware Advanced Audio Coder -- an AAC encoder, providing
	  AAC-LC and HE-AAC v1 (AAC-LC plus SBR).

	  Not in Buildroot's own package set, and the version matters: the
	  modern releases build with Meson and expose a different API
	  (faac_encoder_open / faac_params_init) from the faacEnc* one that
	  distributions carried for years. Raptor's rad uses the modern
	  API, so this package tracks the commit Raptor's own
	  build-standalone.sh pins.

	  https://github.com/knik0/faac
